        "message": "Retain series-10: the native fixes never reached the images\n\nSeries-10's costs-gate liveness death was ruled out by the identical\nwatchdog .so hash (0300429c...) between chains 3ddbfc2 and e41be71:\nthe console-phase5 buildconfig builds Containerfile.console, which\nINHERITS the watchdog .so from the frozen base image (5e68063...) and\nnever compiles native/watchdog.cpp \u2014 the sender thread, the slot-first\nordering and the PostUpdate fill existed only in the source. The\nactual watchdog build is the semantic-safety-phase5 buildconfig\n(Containerfile: COPY source + cmake + ctest). The full chain rebuild\n(base -> console -> phase6 overlay) is in flight; series-10's passing\noff-arm trial retained with the failed on-arm."
